// + the file name at 0x0053a454 + 0x32 * file (0x00466c7d..0x00466c90); fopen(path, "rt" 0x004d3884) (0x00466cbe); NULL returns 0
// (0x00466cca). Lines come from fgets(line, 0xfa, f) (0x00466cf0, 0x00466fe8). A line whose second character is NUL is skipped
// (0x00466d06, not counted). Otherwise its last character is cut (0x00466d1c); key == -1 appends the first such line, closes and
