// state -1 and sel != -1, the saved line is appended when mode != 0 and sel becomes -1 (0x00466ed4..0x00466f20); n grows
// (0x00466f27). Counted lines above 200 close and return fclose's result (0x00466fb7..0x00466fc5). state -1 with sel -1 stops reading
// (0x00466fcc..0x00466fd7). At end of file state -1 with sel != -1 and mode != 1 appends the saved line (0x0046703d..0x0046707f).
// Then fclose (0x00467082); mode != -1 returns mode (0x00467096); mode -1 copies the whole buffer into slot s's text, stores key in
